        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Do you really want to destroy Safe Box **%@**?\n\nDestroying the Safe Box will keep all the files on Koofr but remove the configuration so you won't be able to decrypt the files if you didn't save the configuration.\n\n**This action cannot be undone.**\n\nEnter your Safe Key to confirm the removal:"
          }
        },
        "sl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ali res želite uničiti sef **%@**?\n\nZ uničenjem sefa boste ohranili vse datoteke v Koofru, vendar boste odstranili konfiguracijo, tako da datotek ne boste mogli dešifrirati, če konfiguracije niste shranili.\n\n**Te akcije ne morete preklicati.**\n\nVnesite svoj zasebni ključ, da potrdite odstranitev:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
